  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You may change forms in the blink of an eye.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Quick Wild Shape<sup>UM</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You can wild shape into any form available to you as a move action, and into a form available to a druid two levels lower when using wildshape as a swift action. In addition, you may use expend one use of your mythic power to use wild shape as an immediate action, though you are limited to forms available to a druid four levels lower.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-general-n-s-feats#toc21\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
